  "promptUsed": "{\"tags\":[\"cel-shaded animation\",\"dusk\",\"cityscape\",\"motorcycle\",\"neon lights\",\"urban street\",\"after rain\"],\"short_caption\":\"A cel-shaded animation of a lone motorcyclist riding down a wet city street at dusk, surrounded by glowing neon signs and shopfronts.\",\"long_caption\":\"In a cel-shaded animation style, a lone motorcyclist travels along a wide, asphalt road at dusk. The street is wet from recent rain, with yellow center lines and white lane markings reflecting the glow of surrounding lights. Two-story commercial buildings line the side of the road, featuring storefronts with bright neon signs in shades of pink, yellow, and white. Tall telephone poles stand at regular intervals, connected by a network of power lines that stretch across a deep teal sky. The motorcycle's headlight casts a beam forward, cutting through the dim light of the evening. Each shop window emits a warm light, contributing to the vibrant, high-contrast urban environment. The entire scene is characterized by sharp black outlines and flat color regions typical of traditional animation.\",\"style_and_atmosphere\":\"The scene is in a cel-shaded animation style, featuring thick black outlines and flat, bold color blocks. The atmosphere is quiet and moody, reflecting the stillness of a city at dusk immediately following a rainfall.\",\"lighting\":\"The lighting is dominated by the artificial glow of neon shop signs and the warm yellow light from interior windows. A primary cool teal light comes from the twilight sky, while the motorcycle's headlight provides a concentrated beam of white light.\",\"key_subjects_and_objects\":\"A lone motorcyclist, dressed in dark clothing, is the primary moving subject, seen traveling along the asphalt. The motorcycle is dark in color with a single bright, circular headlight. The buildings are two-story commercial structures with flat roofs and simple rectangular windows, constructed from greyish materials. Neon signs, including rectangular and L-shaped panels, are attached to these storefronts and glow in vibrant pink, yellow, and blue. Telephone poles made of dark wood or metal stand along the sidewalk, supporting thin black power lines. The road surface is dark, polished asphalt with double yellow lines in the center and white dashed lines separating lanes.\",\"environment_and_layout\":\"The scene is set on a wide, multi-lane urban road that stretches into the distance. The storefronts are positioned along one side of the street, each with its own awning and window display. Power lines run parallel to the road, crossing between tall poles that punctuate the sidewalk. The ground is a reflective asphalt surface, showing mirrored versions of the buildings and their neon signage. The sky is a vast, clear expanse of teal, indicating late twilight.\",\"visible_progression\":\"no clear progression is visible across the set.\",\"text_and_ocr\":{\"verbatim_strings\":[],\"notes\":\"none\"},\"artifacts_and_overlays\":\"none\"}",
